      "subject": "fix(governance): track the browser recovery Day-0 coverage is re-proved from (MS-2026-0007)",
      "body": "Day-0 is re-derived with the configured conversation source (KORELUMINA_GENESIS_CHATGPT_BROWSER_RECOVERY_ROOT). With that folder absent, the acquisition inventory differs and Day-0 reads stale, so a fresh clone could not reproduce this machine; the earlier proof ran without the source configured and missed it. The folder (snapshots of the 57 acquired conversations) is now tracked under the owner's decision to commit the conversations, the build check covers it, and .gitignore documents the variable a fresh clone sets. A fresh clone built from git alone, with the variable set and ADR-0045 applied, reports all five activation prerequisites VALID.\n\nMission: MS-2026-0007\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AHtXdN7VRusNxTFHzk5uFe",
